id=b1051c-eink-compat
name=Bigme B1051C Pro E Ink compat (HWC shim + xrz props)
version=0.1.18
versionCode=19
author=matanmi12 + port of awong-dev/hibreak-pro-color hwcshim
description=HWC shim (RGBA client-target commit fix, Bigme colour pipeline: vivid/contrast/brightness + stock LUTs via vendor.xrz.global_*), xrz props, lcd_density 300, stock touch/pen IDC (ORIENTATION_270), SF boot watchdog, HW overlays kept off (SF 1008, re-checked every 10 s), guard for the vendor processImage crash, einkd (check_commit on touch) + shim GC16 every N page turns (clean_frequency), phh-su stub so Magisk late stages run, true Regal (commit 180 when the HWC falls back to 177), RRO: no fade-to-black before sleep + squircle app-icon mask + Wi-Fi-only telephony config, telephony features off (stops the com.android.phone IRadio ANR loop), fingerprint feature off (stops the IVirtualHal wait loop), full surface damage passed as a rect (CPU-drawn apps like KOReader reach the panel), one settled GC16 per full-refresh request, stock-style page count for full refresh every N (only updates covering >= 40 % of the screen), vendor modem init (ccci_mdinit) stopped at boot on this Wi-Fi-only unit, boot display: backpressure off + no shader priming + SF 1008 from the first SurfaceFlinger, whole-buffer damage while booting so the boot animation reaches the panel, no empty (black) frame when SurfaceFlinger dies at shutdown, magnetic cover: close = sleep, open = wake (hall_key.kl), sepolicy for the off-mode charging screen (boot overlay.d bind mounts). Disable: touch /data/adb/modules/b1051c-eink-compat/disable
